# Flutter Monorepo — Testing & Commits

## Testing

Every feature or package change needs tests.

```
packages/<name>/
├── lib/src/my_feature.dart
└── test/my_feature_test.dart   ← mirror the lib/ structure
```

- Widget tests: `flutter_test`
- Pure Dart tests: `package:test`
- Run before any PR: `melos run test`

```dart
// packages/core/test/result_test.dart
void main() {
  test('Success holds value', () {
    const r = Success(42);
    expect(r.value, 42);
  });

  test('Failure holds error', () {
    const r = Failure<int>('network error');
    expect(r.error, 'network error');
  });
}
```

## Pre-commit checklist

```sh
melos run format   # fails if formatting is off
melos run analyze  # fails on lint errors or warnings
melos run test     # must be green
```

## Commit format

```
type(scope): short description
```

| Type | When |
|---|---|
| `feat` | new feature |
| `fix` | bug fix |
| `chore` | build, deps, config |
| `refactor` | restructure without behavior change |
| `test` | tests only |
| `docs` | documentation only |

Scope = package name: `feat(core): ...`, `fix(design_system): ...`
